  "title": "Microsoft Outage Affects Global Users",
  "summary": "Microsoft experienced a major outage starting Sunday evening, affecting both digital and disc-based game access and prices, as well as users' ability to access their Outlook email through web or apps. Microsoft has acknowledged the issue from its Microsoft 365 Status account, stating that 'We've determined a portion of infrastructure is experiencing elevated load across multiple regions.'",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Microsoft experienced a major outage starting Sunday evening, affecting both digital and disc-based game access and prices, as well as users' ability to access their Outlook email through web or apps.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "According to the Verge All Posts report, Microsoft has acknowledged the issue from its Microsoft 365 Status account, stating that 'We've determined a portion of infrastructure is experiencing elevated load across multiple regions.'",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Microsoft has implemented a 'Code Red' initiative to overhaul engineering systems, accelerate software fixes, and introduce faster recovery mechanisms.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
